spice
* NMOS and PMOS transistors
M1 Vout Vb Net2 Net2 PMOS
M2 Vb Vin Net3 Net3 NMOS

* Current sources
I1 VDD Vout DC <Value>
Vin Vin 0 DC <Value>

* Resistor
Rs Vin Vb <Value>

* Voltage source for VDD
VDD VDD 0 DC <Value>

* Ground
VSS 0

* Notes:
* Net2 is used for connections from/I to M1.
* Net3 is used for connections from/I to M2.
* Replace <Value> with specific values for current, voltage, and resistance.